WEBVTT

00:33:56.913 --> 00:34:01.579
And just to update people is artificial
general intelligence.

00:34:01.746 --> 00:34:06.663
Right now, we have incredible examples of
powerful AI operating on specific areas.

00:34:06.871 --> 00:34:12.538
Ajai is the ability of a computer
mind to connect the dots

00:34:12.538 --> 00:34:18.579
and to make decisions at the same level
of breadth that that humans have had.

00:34:18.621 --> 00:34:23.163
What's your sort of elevator pitch on
Ajai about how to identify and how

00:34:23.163 --> 00:34:24.038
to think of it? Yeah, I mean,

00:34:24.038 --> 00:34:26.788
the way that I would say it is that for

00:34:26.788 --> 00:34:30.413
a while we were in this world of like
very narrow A.I. , you know,